WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:06.940
Bethesda Softworks was actually offered to
make an official open world Game of Thrones

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:12.680
game in 2011, but turned it down in order
to make Skyrim.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:23.060
In the early 1900s a group of US government
scientists a private dinner club, in which

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.210
they only ate poisonous food.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:31.779
They documented their illness in order to
convince congress to pass food safety laws.

00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:34.430
The were called “The Poison Squad”.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:40.660
A man named Daniel Balsam got so infuriated
with constant email spam that he quit his

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:46.250
job, got a law degree and has so far earned
over $1 million in court judgements against

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.310
the spammers.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:55.570
Graffiti artist David Choe who painted Facebook's
fist office in 2005 was paid in shares, which

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.290
is now worth over $200 million.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:05.780
13 of the 20 most polluted cities in the world
are in India.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:11.939
During his Indian campaign, Alexander the
Great encountered a tribe that hadn't discovered

00:01:11.939 --> 00:01:14.439
fire yet.

00:01:14.439 --> 00:01:18.590
Prostitution exists amongst some penguins
and chimpanzees.

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:22.560
They prostitute themselves for things like
stones or food.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:28.080
Prince Harry is partial owner of a racehorse
named Usain Colt.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:33.579
A 10-year psychological study found that men
who kissed their wives before leaving for

00:01:33.579 --> 00:01:39.990
work lived, on average, 5 years longer and
earned up to 30 per cent more than peers who

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.079
left without a kiss.

00:01:42.079 --> 00:01:47.369
Odds are, any memory you believe you have
before the age of 4 isn't real.

00:01:47.369 --> 00:01:53.630
They are false memories and have usually either
been told to you by someone else, or you made

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:56.229
them up without knowing it.

00:01:56.229 --> 00:02:02.030
Before 2012, the largest buyer of kale in
the US was Pizza Hut and they only used it

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:04.499
as a garnish around their salad bar.

00:02:04.499 --> 00:02:10.440
During sleep, fluid in the body tends to pool
in low-lying areas, which is why most of us

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:14.390
wake up with noticeable bags under our eyes.

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:21.330
The average Bugatti customer has about 84
cars, 3 jets and one yacht.

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:26.950
Estonian ID cards have a chip with a public-private
key pair that's used to sign documents and

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.470
vote in elections via the internet.

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:35.610
For their 2011 election, 24% of the votes
were cast online.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:41.500
Barely a year after the 1969 moon landing
the American public had completely lost interest

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:46.420
in space exploration, to such an extent that
90 percent of people could not remember Neil

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.200
Armstrong's name.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.230
Octopuses are very intelligent.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:57.370
In 1875, one octopus at the Brighton Aquarium
would escape from its tank when the guards

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:02.840
weren't looking, eat the lump fish in another
tank, then go back to its own tank before

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:07.319
the aquarium opened.

